      <title>英国沃达丰 eSIM 0元购要取消自动续费的看过来</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2402937</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2402937</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 14 Jun 2026 18:23:29 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;应该很多佬都没注意到付款时没取消又怕被反薅羊毛，网页又没地方取消，app不好下，是个小坑，救星来了，通过模拟器安装app来曲线取消，前提是你得能登录账号要收esim的验证码，自己下载安装：&lt;a href=&quot;https://apkcombo.com/zh/my-vodafone/com.myvodafoneapp/download/apk,%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E5%B8%AE%E5%88%B0%E6%9C%89%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%AC%E3%80%82&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;https://apkcombo.com/zh/my-vodafone/com.myvodafoneapp/download/apk,希望帮到有需要的佬。&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/4/a/0/4a07791bdd15b8fe78641539babeda4fb1280539.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/ayTljD3sxhKe1bcOZVnlV0NxIrT.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;pm&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/4/a/0/4a07791bdd15b8fe78641539babeda4fb1280539_2_224x500.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;pm&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;ayTljD3sxhKe1bcOZVnlV0NxIrT&quot; width=&quot;224&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/4/a/0/4a07791bdd15b8fe78641539babeda4fb1280539_2_224x500.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/4/a/0/4a07791bdd15b8fe78641539babeda4fb1280539_2_336x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/4/a/0/4a07791bdd15b8fe78641539babeda4fb1280539_2_448x1000.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;685A59&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
